{'symbol': 'IBM', 'date': '2023-04-25 08:30:00', 'title': 'ROCKET SOFTWARE STRENGTHENS INVESTMENTS IN OPEN-SOURCE SOLUTIONS FOR Z/OS®, UNDERSCORING COMMITMENT TO IBM® ZSYSTEMS™ SECURITY, COMPLIANCE, AND INNOVATION1', 'text': "WALTHAM, MASS.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--ROCKET SOFTWARE, A GLOBAL TECHNOLOGY LEADER THAT DEVELOPS ENTERPRISE SOFTWARE FOR SOME OF THE WORLD'S LARGEST COMPANIES, TODAY ANNOUNCED ENHANCEMENTS TO ITS OPEN SOURCE SOLUTIONS FOR Z/OS, ROCKET® OPEN APPDEV FOR Z AND ROCKET® SUPPORT FOR ZOWE™—AN OPEN-SOURCE FRAMEWORK FOR Z/OS FROM OPEN MAINFRAME PROJECT™—TO FURTHER MODERNIZE MAINFRAME DEVOPS, APPLICATION DEVELOPMENT, AND UNIX SYSTEMS SERVICES (USS) ADMINISTRATION WHILE ENSURING SECURITY AND COMPLIANCE.2 ORGANI."}